              Get Started
            </a>
            <a href="#services" className="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 font-bold transition-all hover:border-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-700">
              Explore Services
            </a>
